es in internal medicine, pediatrics, obstetrics and gynecology."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a kind doctor who helps the protagonist with his strange illness of \"overly energetic penis\". She also teaches him some adult etiquette."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8f2b4faa30b34f1f3c2b6bf43760c1aff4300514e752393b1ed092d6666f1c17.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d8d0232e7d9475b405be297e9b68355cdff5e8f9dd3d7ad8c9d08ae0c029286.webp","width":200,"height":240,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p210","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:369","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p210","name":"オーサリングヘヴン","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:2772:369","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p210","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p210","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p210","name":"オーサリングヘヴン","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:14077:v6059","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
